---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
title: "Gatorbacks Charter Fishing Tampa FL | Redfish Trips"
description: "Charter fishing in Tampa Bay with Capt. William Ashmore, a Florida native with 40+ years on these waters. Redfish, snook & more. Book online."
hero: hero-redfish-mangroves.jpg
---
{% import "partials.njk" as ui %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "LocalBusiness",
  "@id": "{{ site.url }}/#business",
  "name": "{{ site.name }}",
  "url": "{{ site.url }}/",
  "telephone": "+1-813-714-5670",
  "image": "{{ site.url }}/og-image.jpg",
  "logo": "{{ site.url }}/apple-touch-icon.png",
  "description": "Fishing charters in Tampa Bay, the Gulf and the lakes around Kissimmee with Capt. William Ashmore.",
  "founder": { "@type": "Person", "name": "William Ashmore", "jobTitle": "Captain" },
  "address": { "@type": "PostalAddress", "addressLocality": "Plant City", "addressRegion": "FL", "postalCode": "33567", "addressCountry": "US" },
  "areaServed": [
    { "@type": "City", "name": "Tampa" },
    { "@type": "City", "name": "St. Petersburg" },
    { "@type": "City", "name": "Clearwater" },
    { "@type": "City", "name": "Anna Maria" },
    { "@type": "City", "name": "Kissimmee" }
  ],
  "priceRange": "$$$",
  "sameAs": ["{{ site.facebook }}"]
}
</script>

<section class="hero hero--home" id="top">
  {% heroImage hero, "Smiling angler holding a redfish in front of the mangroves", "70% 40%" %}
  <div class="hero__shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero__content">
    <div class="wrap hero__inner">
      <h1>Tampa Bay Fishing Charters</h1>
      <a class="btn btn--light" href="#charters">See Our Charters</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="intro">
  <div class="wrap intro__grid">
    <p class="intro__statement">Redfish along the mangroves, snook in the bay, and a cooler of snapper back at the dock by sunset.</p>
    <div class="intro__copy">
      <p>Tell us what you want to catch. Capt. Ashmore has fished Tampa Bay for more than 40 years and knows where to find it, whether that's inshore, out in the Gulf or on the lakes around Kissimmee.</p>
      <p>Your license, rods and tackle are covered, and your fish are cleaned before you head home.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="day" aria-label="A day on the water">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="accent-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="day__grid">
      <figure class="photo-card">
        <img src="/images/snook-smiling-angler.jpg" alt="Smiling angler holding a snook on the boat" sizes="(max-width: 699px) 100vw, (max-width: 1080px) 50vw, 380px" style="object-position:50% 35%">
        <figcaption><p class="photo-card__title">In the bay</p><p>Redfish, snook and trout along the mangroves and shorelines of Tampa Bay.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="photo-card">
        <img src="/images/gag-grouper-young-angler.jpg" alt="Young angler holding a gag grouper on the boat" sizes="(max-width: 699px) 100vw, (max-width: 1080px) 50vw, 380px" style="object-position:50% 40%">
        <figcaption><p class="photo-card__title">Out in the Gulf</p><p>Run past the beaches for grouper, snapper and hogfish.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="photo-card">
        <img src="/images/dock-sunset-grouper-hogfish.jpg" alt="Angler on the dock at sunset holding a red grouper and a hogfish" sizes="(max-width: 699px) 100vw, (max-width: 1080px) 50vw, 380px" style="object-position:50% 25%">
        <figcaption><p class="photo-card__title">Back at the dock</p><p>Fish cleaning is included, so the cooler goes home ready to cook.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{{ ui.wave("top") }}
<section class="band" id="reviews">
  <div class="wrap section--tight">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>What Anglers Say</h2>
      <a class="text-link" href="/reviews/">Read all reviews</a>
    </div>
    {{ ui.reviewsWidget(site) }}
  </div>
</section>
{{ ui.wave("bottom") }}

<section class="section" id="charters">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Our Charters</h2>
      <p>Tap a trip to see the details on the Charters page.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="trip-cards">
      {%- for t in trips %}
      <a class="trip-card" href="/charters/#{{ t.id }}">
        <div class="trip-card__media">
          <img src="/images/{{ t.img }}" alt="{{ t.alt }}" sizes="(max-width: 699px) 100vw, (max-width: 1080px) 50vw, 380px" style="object-position:{{ t.pos }}">
          <span class="price-pill">{{ t.price }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trip-card__body">
          <h3>{{ t.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ t.card }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn btn--book btn--lg" href="{{ site.bookUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ site.bookLabel }}</a>
      <span>or call or text <a class="strong blue" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="includes">
  <div class="wrap includes__inner">
    <h2>Every Trip Includes</h2>
    <ul class="includes__list">
      <li>{{ ui.check() }}Your fishing license</li>
      <li>{{ ui.check() }}Rods, reels and tackle</li>
      <li>{{ ui.check() }}Fish cleaning</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="includes__note">Just bring drinks (no glass), snacks, sunglasses and sunscreen.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split-head">
      <h2>Fishing Charters Close to Where You're Staying</h2>
      <p>Staying in Tampa, St. Pete, Clearwater or on Anna Maria? You're in the right place. We also run crappie trips on the lakes around Kissimmee, and we'll confirm where to meet when you book.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="towns">
      {%- for town in towns %}
      <figure class="town">
        {% if town.img %}<img src="/images/{{ town.img }}" alt="{{ town.alt }}" sizes="(max-width: 699px) 100vw, 240px">{% else %}<div class="town__pending">Photo: [{{ town.placeholder }}]</div>{% endif %}
        <div class="town__shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <figcaption>{{ town.name }}</figcaption>
      </figure>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="captain" id="captain">
  <div class="wrap captain__grid">
    <img src="/images/capt-ashmore-hogfish-cropped.jpg" alt="Capt. William Ashmore holding a hogfish offshore" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 580px" style="object-position:50% 30%">
    <div>
      <h2>Meet Capt. William Ashmore</h2>
      <p>A Florida native, Capt. Ashmore has spent more than 40 years fishing Tampa Bay and Central Florida.</p>
      <p>He holds a USCG 100 ton Master license, and guests say he brings lots of knowledge and a calm, cool demeanor to the boat.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/about/">More about Capt. Ashmore</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--flush-top" id="gallery">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>From the Boat</h2>
      <a class="text-link" href="/gallery/">See the full gallery</a>
    </div>
    <div class="boat-grid">
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/redfish-angler-2-LOWRES.jpg" alt="Angler holding a redfish on the boat" sizes="(max-width: 699px) 100vw, 290px" style="object-position:50% 30%"></a>
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/cooler-of-snapper.jpg" alt="Cooler full of mangrove snapper" sizes="(max-width: 699px) 100vw, 290px"></a>
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/snook-angler-on-deck.jpg" alt="Angler kneeling on the deck with a big snook" sizes="(max-width: 699px) 100vw, 290px" style="object-position:50% 45%"></a>
      <a href="/gallery/"><img src="/images/two-redfish-LOWRES.jpg" alt="Angler holding two redfish" sizes="(max-width: 699px) 100vw, 290px" style="object-position:50% 30%"></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gift">
  <div class="wrap gift__inner">
    <p class="strong">Give someone a day on the water. Gift cards come in any amount.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="{{ site.giftCardUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy a gift card</a>
  </div>
</section>

{{ ui.bookBand(site) }}
{{ ui.reviewsLoader() }}
